# Why layering does not relax the invariant

<v-clicks>

- **Zero unreceipted actuation** — the constitutional invariant (`CONSTITUTION.md`) holds at every layer, not just the innermost one
- IaaS actuates infrastructure; PaaS actuates a managed pipeline; SaaS actuates on a tenant's behalf
- Every one of those still needs a real, signed receipt before it counts as done
- **BRCE bites hardest at the outermost layer** — the more automated the dispatch, the more the receipt chain has to carry the weight a human review used to

</v-clicks>

