# SaaS — receipt as the product

Not a new concept, only a new audience: the receipt chain **is** the
product, not the plumbing behind it.

<v-clicks>

- Capability catalog UI
- Per-invocation metering
- Tamper-evident, isolated audit log store
- Signed, expiring asset URLs
- Trust-tier-aware pricing/gating

</v-clicks>

<div class="pt-6 text-sm opacity-60">
What this does not resolve: no purchase/fulfillment/entitlement path exists yet.
